ource first to learn the effect of using it. Some resources are consumables; using edible resources (e.g., Berries) can reduce hunger.\n\nA plan must include no more than 8 steps including all nested while and if branches.\n\n\n\nRespond only with JSON, no other text. End with </end>\n'}]

